# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the TSan CI job.
#
# Asio releases reference-counted objects (strands, executor targets) with a
# release fetch_sub followed by a standalone acquire fence. TSan does not
# model standalone fences, so the delete after the last release is reported
# as racing with the decrement in another thread.
race:boost::asio::detail::ref_count_down
